      "value": "@{62deec4f4d073344a45f1b9c|full_name} I believe this is wrong, Looking at VRChat devs with their own badges, Community testers have their own badges, it seems Highly illogical when there’s already a well designed badges system in-place, creating more unnecessary UI and confusion to users",
