      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62e03f4e44af5544b2228fa5|full_name}  VRChat staff have the option to choose whether or not to display their badges because it's the only indicator there is that they are staff, meaning the option gives them a degree of privacy. Creator tags meanwhile are only found on the profiles of people who are sellers in the creator economy/avatar marketplace, which means they already have content that publicly reveals them as being such already, so no secret/private information is being shared against their will. It's really just a shorthand way to recognize creators while also helping combat with impersonation.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
