      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{60e65f577ae9d0492b0f2a75|full_name} Trust Rank and Age Verification (and current VRC+ status, sorta, since it also has a badge) aren't badges either, so there's at least precedent for other profile indicators besides just the badge system. Admittedly it is a bit hard to discern what criteria separates them in VRChat's view. But given that badges would have certainly been the easier of the routes to implement, the decision to make it not a badge seems particularly intentional. Perhaps because badges tend to be taken as clout/flair, and this is meant more for verification?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
